  "title": "National CineMedia Announces Top 25 US Young Lions Competition Finalist Teams",
  "summary": "National CineMedia (NASDAQ: NCMI), the US Representative of the Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity, has announced the Top 25 finalist teams for the 2026 US Young Lions Competition. This year's brief challenged competitors to reimagine fundraising efforts for nonprofit partner Save The Music, engaging a new generation of music lovers. Finalists span five categories: Digital, Film, Media, PR, and Print.",
